sequenceDiagram


activate User
User -> App: Open application
activate App
App -> User: Profile page
User -> App: History page request

App -> db: Retrieve user trips
activate db
db --> App: Trip list
deactivate db
App -> User: History page

User -> App: Select trip to delete
App -> User: Deletion confirmation request
User -> App: Confirm deletion

App -> db: Delete trip from user history
activate db
db --> App: Trip deleted
deactivate db

App -> User: Updated history page
deactivate App
